      "item_id": "A005-000002-NG-001",
      "item_type": "explicit_non_gap",
      "title": "Closed envelope and minimum identity/routing structure are falsifiable",
      "statement": "The schema gives failed-attempt artifacts a closed top-level envelope, fixed schema and artifact discriminators, required project/run/attempt identity, at least one non-empty routing reference, and a non-empty type payload. These constraints provide deterministic rejection oracles for absent required fields, wrong discriminators, unexpected top-level keys, empty routing arrays, and empty payload objects, although they do not establish semantic validity.",
