    {
      "item_id": "A005-000002-G-001",
      "item_type": "gap",
      "title": "Opaque references leave consumers, authority, trust, and seams unenforced",
      "statement": "All identifiers and references are untyped strings, most permit empty strings, and the schema expresses no reference namespace, target artifact kind, existence rule, ownership or tenant binding, producer/actor authorization, integrity digest, or allowed consumer. A structurally valid artifact can therefore be orphaned, cross-project, misrouted, forged, or resolved by incompatible consumers without schema failure.",
