    {
      "item_id": "A005-000002-G-004",
      "item_type": "gap",
      "title": "Privacy, human-facing content, scale, migration, and support contracts are underspecified",
      "statement": "retention_class is an unconstrained string with no expiry, purge, legal-hold, redaction, sensitivity, or data-residency fields. summary and referenced content have no locale, message key, text direction, accessibility alternative, safe-display marker, or untrusted-content treatment. Strings, arrays, and type_payload are effectively unbounded; created_at_utc lacks date-time format; schema v1 supplies no prior-version migration or forward-compatibility rule; and there is no structured error taxonomy, trace/span identifier, support correlation key, or invariant tying projection health to evidence. These omissions permit resource exhaustion, ambiguous migration failure, inaccessible or misleading presentation, and weak operational diagnosis while still passing validation.",
